{"4462330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "corescapes", "steam_appid": 4462330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>corescapes</strong> is an online coop liminal wave defense and exploration game, where your goal is simple: <strong>protect the core and feed it remnant</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/3a9de5c8578d4e5e80559cd7f83319f1.poster.avif?t=1784360947\" width=348 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/3a9de5c8578d4e5e80559cd7f83319f1.webm?t=1784360947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/3a9de5c8578d4e5e80559cd7f83319f1.mp4?t=1784360947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >defend the CORE against onslaughts of enemies based on various internet aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each aesthetic gets a boss fight  (weirdcore, webcore, liminalcore, dreamcore, etc.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/49cf114eb9119ae5f64c245227c513aa.poster.avif?t=1784360947\" width=348 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/49cf114eb9119ae5f64c245227c513aa.webm?t=1784360947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/49cf114eb9119ae5f64c245227c513aa.mp4?t=1784360947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traverse and explore through various liminal spaces in search of remnant to stabilize the CORE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock and gain new teammates, weapons, remnant as you warp across voidscapes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADAPT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/48597c2d475d154af52126e108d6c4aa.poster.avif?t=1784360947\" width=348 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/48597c2d475d154af52126e108d6c4aa.webm?t=1784360947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/48597c2d475d154af52126e108d6c4aa.mp4?t=1784360947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose a class and forge a build from a wide arsenal of weapons and utilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >expand your skill set, purchasable items, and a growth tree between runs</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>corescapes</strong> is an online coop liminal wave defense and exploration game, where your goal is simple: <strong>protect the core and feed it remnant</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/3a9de5c8578d4e5e80559cd7f83319f1.poster.avif?t=1784360947\" width=348 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462330/extras/3a9de5c8578d4e5e80559cd7f83319f1.webm?t=1784360947\" type=\"vid